<main><section class="hero wrap"><div><span class="kicker">Jaguar · Beyond-1 model lab</span><h1>Intelligence with a <span>purpose.</span></h1><p class="lead">Jaguar is the AI platform we are building for the Beyond ecosystem—designed to make technology more understandable, creation more approachable and every next step more useful.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="#roadmap">See what we’re building ↓</a><a class="button" href="<?=e(beyond_url('academy/'))?>">Explore Academy →</a></div><div class="hero-stats"><div><b>Beyond-1</b><span>foundation model lab</span></div><div><b>Learn + Create</b><span>the first experiences</span></div><div><b>In development</b><span>built with care</span></div></div></div><div class="hero-art"><video autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="assets/jaguar-hero.jpg" aria-label="Jaguar AI motion visual"><source src="assets/jaguar-hero.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><span class="art-status">● BUILDING</span><span class="art-label">JAGUAR / BEYOND-1</span></div></section>
<section class="section wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="kicker">The Jaguar approach</span><h2>Useful AI begins with people.</h2></div><p>We are not building AI for spectacle. Jaguar starts with a practical promise: explain things clearly, help people make progress and keep the human in control of the work.</p></div><div class="capabilities"><article class="card"><span class="number">01 · UNDERSTAND</span><h3>Make complexity clear.</h3><p>Jaguar is being shaped to turn unfamiliar concepts into plain language, useful examples and a next step that makes sense.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="number">02 · CREATE</span><h3>Move ideas forward.</h3><p>From a loose thought to a better prompt, outline or first draft, Jaguar will help creators make the blank page less intimidating.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="number">03 · CONNECT</span><h3>Work across Beyond.</h3><p>Learning and creator experiences will inform a growing AI capability across the Beyond product family—not a disconnected assistant.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="section wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="kicker">Jaguar Thinking</span><h2>One Jaguar. Different ways to think.</h2></div><p>Thinking modes are the product layer above the model. Explain and Code are the first text experiences; Research, Translate, Speak and Draw will arrive as the platform grows.</p></div><div class="thinking-grid"><article class="thinking-card"><b>01 · LIVE</b><h3>Explain</h3><p>Learn difficult ideas in plain language, with analogies and a useful next step.</p><small>Free preview</small></article><article class="thinking-card"><b>02 · PREVIEW</b><h3>Code</h3><p>Plan, write and debug with a careful coding partner that explains its assumptions.</p><small>Free preview</small></article><article class="thinking-card"><b>03 · NEXT</b><h3>Research</h3><p>Deeper retrieval and synthesis for questions that need evidence and context.</p><small>Planned · 2 credits</small></article><article class="thinking-card"><b>04 · NEXT</b><h3>Translate</h3><p>Carry meaning, tone and cultural context across languages.</p><small>Planned · 1 credit</small></article><article class="thinking-card"><b>05 · GPU</b><h3>Speak</h3><p>Turn Jaguar answers into natural voice when the audio pipeline is ready.</p><small>Planned · 5 credits</small></article><article class="thinking-card"><b>06 · GPU</b><h3>Draw</h3><p>Turn an intent into a visual brief and a generated image through a GPU workflow.</p><small>Planned · 10 credits</small></article></div></section>
<section class="wrap"><div class="blueprint"><div><span class="kicker">How it comes together</span><h2>One model lab.<br>Many useful moments.</h2><p>Jaguar is a long-term capability, introduced through focused experiences where it can earn trust and create real value.</p></div><div class="steps"><div class="step"><b>01</b><span>Teach AI in the Academy with examples people can use.</span></div><div class="step"><b>02</b><span>Support creators as they shape ideas, content and plans.</span></div><div class="step"><b>03</b><span>Learn from the needs that recur across live Beyond products.</span></div><div class="step"><b>04</b><span>Expand responsibly into more connected experiences.</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="wrap"><div class="story"><div class="story-image"><img src="assets/jaguar-runner.jpg" alt="Jaguar moving through a digital landscape"></div><div class="story-copy"><span class="kicker">A distinct identity</span><h3>Fast, focused and built to move ideas forward.</h3><p>Jaguar gives Beyond AI a recognizable character—but the work behind it is grounded in practical learning, deliberate product design and responsible growth.</p><a class="button" href="<?=e(beyond_url())?>">Explore the ecosystem →</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section wrap" id="roadmap"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="kicker">Building in the open</span><h2>The path to Jaguar.</h2></div><p>These are the product layers we are working toward. Each stage is meant to be useful on its own while strengthening the foundation for what follows.</p></div><div class="roadmap"><article><span>NOW · FOUNDATION</span><h3>AI literacy</h3><p>Practical lessons and guided examples that help people understand how to use AI thoughtfully and effectively.</p></article><article><span>NEXT · EXPERIENCES</span><h3>Creator support</h3><p>Purpose-built assistance for turning intent into better prompts, drafts, learning plans and creative starting points.</p></article><article><span>AHEAD · PLATFORM</span><h3>Connected intelligence</h3><p>A trusted Jaguar capability that can support more of the Beyond ecosystem while maintaining clear human direction.</p></article></div></section></main>
